{"name":"Glimpse","hex":"#4fb9ce","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"glimpse","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To see or view (someone, or something tangible) briefly and incompletely.","Chiefly followed by at or upon: to look at briefly and incompletely; to glance."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Chiefly followed by of: a brief and incomplete look.","A brief, sudden flash of light; a glimmer."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/glimpse"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Glimpse","blocks":[{"text":"The Glimpse is an album by British jazz pianist Robert Mitchell. It was released on 18 February 2013 by Whirlwind Recordings."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1b/Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Glimpse","wikidata":"Q17125462"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1b/Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg/250px-Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/1b/Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/1/1b/Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg/250px-Robertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARobertmitchelltheglimpsecover.jpg"}],"sounds":{"glimpse":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/29/En-us-glimpse.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/29/En-us-glimpse.ogg/En-us-glimpse.ogg.mp3"}]}}}